# The old static site deploys the repo root. web/ is the Next.js app, which
# deploys from its own Vercel project (Root Directory: web), so keep its
# source out of the static site.
/web

# Internal notes and the Flask API source. No page loads anything from these
# paths, and without this Vercel serves them publicly (for example
# /AGENT_WORKLOG.md and /backend/requirements.txt).
/docs
/backend
/AGENT_WORKLOG.md
/REVIEW_NOTES.md
